{"id": "922038cc-1877-49c3-9bd6-ba3ce7eddb73", "slug": "nexus-streamline-operations-1", "title": "Nexus - Streamline Operations", "description": "Nexus Streamline Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nexus - Streamline Operations\"\ndescription: \"Nexus Streamline Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#A855F7\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#3B82F6\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#222222\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#999999\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"11px\"\n  control: \"15px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus - Streamline Operations\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 6; favorites: 8; remixes: 0.\nTags: testimonial, section, animated, cta, social-proof.\n## Overview\nNexus Streamline Testimonial Section is designed for showcasing social proof and customer credibility. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNexus Product Solutions Resources Enterprise EN Start building Next-gen workflow engine Streamline Your Operations, Tasks, and Data Unify your entire stack and accelerate delivery, whether you're a startup or an enterpr…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Streamline Your Operations, Tasks, and Data.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #A855F7, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #3B82F6, background #FFFFFF, surface #222222, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Geist for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased scroll-smooth\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus - Streamline Operations</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin=\"\">\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Three.js for WebGL Background -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <!-- GSAP for Animations -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        gray: {\n                            900: '#111',\n                            800: '#222',\n                            400: '#999',\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n<link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-geist\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\"><style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-geist\">.font-geist { font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif !important; }</style></head>\n<body class=\"bg-black text-white font-sans overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-white/20\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Container -->\n    <div id=\"canvas-container\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-80\" style=\"mix-blend-mode: screen;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Dotted Grid Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Diagonal Lines -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-[0.02]\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #fff 0, #fff 1px, transparent 0, transparent 50%); background-size: 10px 10px;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Main Layout Wrapper (Frame Removed as requested) -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8\">\n\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl flex-grow relative flex flex-col items-center pt-24 pb-40\">\n\n            <!-- Header / Navbar -->\n            <header class=\"fixed top-8 z-50 w-[calc(100%-2rem)] sm:w-auto max-w-4xl mx-auto px-1 sm:px-2 py-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-xl flex items-center justify-between gap-4 sm:gap-12 shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 4px 24px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n                <!-- Logo -->\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 pl-3 sm:pl-4\">\n                    <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-fuchsia-500 flex items-center justify-center transform rotate-45\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.5);\">\n                        <div class=\"w-3 h-3 bg-black transform -rotate-45\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"font-medium text-lg tracking-tight font-geist\">Nexus</span>\n                </a>\n\n                <!-- Nav Links -->\n                <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 lg:gap-8 text-sm font-medium text-gray-300\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\">Product</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\">Solutions</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\">Resources</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\">Enterprise</a>\n                </nav>\n\n                <!-- Actions -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 pr-1 sm:pr-2\">\n                    <button class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full hover:bg-white/5 transition-colors text-sm font-medium text-gray-300 border border-transparent hover:border-white/10\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:global-linear\" width=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <span class=\"font-geist\">EN</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-down-linear\" width=\"14\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"relative group inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 sm:px-5 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white bg-white/5 rounded-full overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n                        <span class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center gap-2 font-geist\">\n                            Start building\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" width=\"16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </span>\n                        <!-- Border Gradient Glow -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent translate-x-[-100%] group-hover:translate-x-[100%] transition-transform duration-700 ease-out\"></div>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </header>\n\n            <!-- Main Content Area -->\n            <main class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center mt-20 sm:mt-32 px-4 max-w-5xl mx-auto w-full\">\n\n                <!-- Pill Badge (No icons, light font weight) -->\n                <div class=\"inline-flex items-center px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] backdrop-blur-sm mb-8 sm:mb-12 shadow-lg\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n                    <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-light text-gray-300 tracking-wide font-geist\">Next-gen workflow engine</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Hero Heading -->\n                <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-[80px] leading-[1.1] font-semibold tracking-tight text-white mb-6 md:mb-8 reveal-container flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2 sm:gap-x-5\">\n                    <div class=\"reveal-word inline-block\"><div class=\"translate-y-full opacity-0 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">Streamline</div></div>\n\n                    <!-- Inline Gradient Icon -->\n                    <div class=\"reveal-word inline-flex items-center justify-center align-middle w-12 h-12 sm:w-16 sm:h-16 md:w-20 md:h-20 rounded-xl sm:rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 via-purple-500 to-pink-500 p-[1px] shadow-2xl relative\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);\">\n                        <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[11px] sm:rounded-[15px] flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:double-alt-arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-white text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"reveal-word inline-block\"><div class=\"translate-y-full opacity-0 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">Your</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"reveal-word inline-block\"><div class=\"translate-y-full opacity-0 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">Operations,</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-full h-0\"></div> <!-- Line break force -->\n                    <div class=\"reveal-word inline-block\"><div class=\"translate-y-full opacity-0 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">Tasks,</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"reveal-word inline-block\"><div class=\"translate-y-full opacity-0 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">and</div></div>\n                    <div class=\"reveal-word inline-block\"><div class=\"translate-y-full opacity-0 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">Data</div></div>\n                </h1>\n\n                <!-- Subtitle -->\n                <p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-400 font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-14 reveal-fade opacity-0 translate-y-4 leading-relaxed font-geist\">\n                    Unify your entire stack and accelerate delivery, whether you're a startup or an enterprise scaling globally.\n                </p>\n\n                <!-- Primary CTA (Skeuomorphic with Flashlight) -->\n                <div class=\"reveal-fade opacity-0 translate-y-4 relative group inline-block\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" id=\"flashlight-btn\" class=\"relative overflow-hidden flex items-center gap-2 px-8 sm:px-10 py-3.5 sm:py-4 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-[#3a3a3a] to-[#1a1a1a] border border-black text-white font-medium transition-transform duration-100 active:scale-95\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.2), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\">\n                        <!-- Flashlight Layer -->\n                        <div id=\"flashlight-glow\" class=\"absolute pointer-events-none rounded-full\" style=\"width: 160px; height: 160px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, transparent 60%); top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease;\"></div>\n\n                        <span class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center gap-2 drop-shadow-[0_1px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] font-geist\">\n                            Start building\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-gray-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </span>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Social Proof Section -->\n                <div class=\"mt-20 sm:mt-28 w-full border-t border-white/5 pt-10 reveal-fade opacity-0 translate-y-4\">\n                    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 font-medium mb-8 uppercase tracking-widest font-geist\">Trusted by innovative teams</p>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center items-center gap-8 sm:gap-16 opacity-50 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-check-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"font-medium text-lg tracking-tight font-geist\">SecureNet</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"font-medium text-lg tracking-tight font-geist\">DataFlow</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:server-square-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"font-medium text-lg tracking-tight font-geist\">CloudSync</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-minimalistic-linear\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                            <span class=\"font-medium text-lg tracking-tight font-geist\">BlockBase</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </main>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <style>\n        /* CSS for staggered reveal mask */\n        .reveal-word {\n            overflow: hidden;\n            vertical-align: top;\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- Flashlight Button Effect ---\n        const btn = document.getElementById('flashlight-btn');\n        const glow = document.getElementById('flashlight-glow');\n\n        if (btn && glow) {\n            btn.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const rect = btn.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const x = e.clientX - rect.left;\n                const y = e.clientY - rect.top;\n                glow.style.left = `${x}px`;\n                glow.style.top = `${y}px`;\n                glow.style.opacity = '1';\n            });\n\n            btn.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                glow.style.opacity = '0';\n            });\n        }\n\n        // --- GSAP Animations ---\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        // Staggered text reveal\n        const words = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-word > div');\n        gsap.to(words, {\n            y: \"0%\",\n            opacity: 1,\n            duration: 0.8,\n            stagger: 0.05,\n            ease: \"power3.out\",\n            delay: 0.2\n        });\n\n        // Fade in subtitle, button, and social proof\n        const fades = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-fade');\n        gsap.to(fades, {\n            y: 0,\n            opacity: 1,\n            duration: 1,\n            stagger: 0.2,\n            ease: \"power3.out\",\n            delay: 0.8\n        });\n\n        // --- WebGL Background Mesh Animation (Three.js) ---\n        const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n\n        // Scene setup\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n        const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: true });\n\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n        container.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n        // Create a plane geometry with high segment count for smooth waves\n        const geometry = new THREE.PlaneGeometry(30, 15, 64, 64);\n\n        // Custom Shader Material to mimic the glowing gradient waves\n        const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n            wireframe: false,\n            transparent: true,\n            uniforms: {\n                uTime: { value: 0 },\n                uColor1: { value: new THREE.Color('#3b82f6') }, // Blue\n                uColor2: { value: new THREE.Color('#a855f7') }, // Purple\n                uColor3: { value: new THREE.Color('#ec4899') }  // Pink\n            },\n            vertexShader: `\n                uniform float uTime;\n                varying vec2 vUv;\n                varying vec3 vPos;\n\n                // Simplex noise function (simplified for inline)\n                vec3 mod289(vec3 x) { return x - floor(x * (1.0 / 289.0)) * 289.0; }\n                vec2 mod289(vec2 x) { return x - floor(x * (1.0 / 289.0)) * 289.0; }\n                vec3 permute(vec3 x) { return mod289(((x*34.0)+1.0)*x); }\n                float snoise(vec2 v) {\n                    const vec4 C = vec4(0.211324865405187, 0.366025403784439, -0.577350269189626, 0.024390243902439);\n                    vec2 i  = floor(v + dot(v, C.yy) );\n                    vec2 x0 = v -   i + dot(i, C.xx);\n                    vec2 i1; i1 = (x0.x > x0.y) ? vec2(1.0, 0.0) : vec2(0.0, 1.0);\n                    vec4 x12 = x0.xyxy + C.xxzz;\n                    x12.xy -= i1;\n                    i = mod289(i);\n                    vec3 p = permute( permute( i.y + vec3(0.0, i1.y, 1.0 )) + i.x + vec3(0.0, i1.x, 1.0 ));\n                    vec3 m = max(0.5 - vec3(dot(x0,x0), dot(x12.xy,x12.xy), dot(x12.zw,x12.zw)), 0.0);\n                    m = m*m ; m = m*m ;\n                    vec3 x = 2.0 * fract(p * C.www) - 1.0;\n                    vec3 h = abs(x) - 0.5;\n                    vec3 ox = floor(x + 0.5);\n                    vec3 a0 = x - ox;\n                    m *= 1.79284291400159 - 0.85373472095314 * ( a0*a0 + h*h );\n                    vec3 g;\n                    g.x  = a0.x  * x0.x  + h.x  * x0.y;\n                    g.yz = a0.yz * x12.xz + h.yz * x12.yw;\n                    return 130.0 * dot(m, g);\n                }\n\n                void main() {\n                    vUv = uv;\n                    vec3 pos = position;\n\n                    // Add wave motion based on noise and time\n                    float noiseFreq = 0.5;\n                    float noiseAmp = 1.5;\n                    vec2 noisePos = vec2(pos.x * noiseFreq + uTime * 0.2, pos.y * noiseFreq);\n                    pos.z += snoise(noisePos) * noiseAmp;\n\n                    // Secondary wave\n                    pos.z += sin(pos.x * 0.8 + uTime * 0.5) * 0.5;\n\n                    vPos = pos;\n                    gl_Position = projectionMatrix * modelViewMatrix * vec4(pos, 1.0);\n                }\n            `,\n            fragmentShader: `\n                uniform vec3 uColor1;\n                uniform vec3 uColor2;\n                uniform vec3 uColor3;\n                varying vec2 vUv;\n                varying vec3 vPos;\n\n                void main() {\n                    // Mix colors based on UV and depth (Z position)\n                    float mix1 = smoothstep(0.0, 1.0, vUv.x + sin(vPos.z * 0.5) * 0.2);\n                    float mix2 = smoothstep(0.0, 1.0, vUv.y - vPos.z * 0.1);\n\n                    vec3 color = mix(uColor1, uColor2, mix1);\n                    color = mix(color, uColor3, mix2);\n\n                    // Fade out edges\n                    float alpha = smoothstep(0.0, 0.2, vUv.x) * smoothstep(1.0, 0.8, vUv.x) *\n                                  smoothstep(0.0, 0.3, vUv.y) * smoothstep(1.0, 0.5, vUv.y);\n\n                    // Extra fade based on height to match the reference bottom glow\n                    alpha *= smoothstep(0.8, 0.0, vUv.y);\n\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(color, alpha * 0.8);\n                }\n            `\n        });\n\n        const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geometry, material);\n\n        // Position at the bottom, rotated to lay flat but angled towards camera\n        mesh.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 3;\n        mesh.position.y = -4;\n        mesh.position.z = -5;\n        scene.add(mesh);\n\n        camera.position.z = 5;\n\n        // Animation Loop\n        const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n            // Update shader time uniform\n            material.uniforms.uTime.value = elapsedTime;\n\n            // Slow continuous rotation\n            mesh.rotation.z = Math.sin(elapsedTime * 0.1) * 0.1;\n\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        }\n        animate();\n\n        // Handle Resize\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-streamline-operations-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexus-streamline-operations-1.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-streamline-operations-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 68, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-30T17:03:02.750195+00:00"}